The port lives in crates/lutmatrix-opendrt; the DCTL it follows is included there
unmodified (crates/lutmatrix-opendrt/opendrt/OpenDRT_v1.1.0.1.dctl). That file is
upstream OpenDRT v1.1.0 (commit af68332) with local changes made before it reached this
project: an added "Standard 2" look, a different "DaGrinchi Tonegroan" tonescale, and
surround compensation set to dark for every display encoding preset.
